            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Google vs. Meta, Boeing-Airbus, Chipotle: Trending Stocks",
            "description": "<p>Why did Alphabet (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOG\">GOOG</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOGL\">GOOGL</a>) soar while Meta (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/META\">META</a>) plummeted in premarket, in the wake of respective earnings reports? In aviation, the divide between Boeing (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BA\">BA</a>) and Airbus  (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AIR.PA\">AIR.PA</a>) deepens, with the American plane maker's stock sliding - while its European rival rallies. Chipotle (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CMG\">CMG</a>) tanks nearly 19% in premarket, along with other restaurant chains (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/CAVA\">CAVA</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/WING\">WING</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SHAK\">SHAK</a>) also in the red. In semiconductors, Samsung (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/005930.KS\">005930.KS</a>) and Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) are trending.</p>\n<p>For more live coverage of markets watch the full episode of<a data-i13n=\"cpos:12;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cLr6hc2-oMY&list=PLx28zU8ctIRqTE7Y4uXTY-S2oHlwDsL5c\"> Market Sunrise</a> and head to<a data-i13n=\"cpos:13;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/\"> Yahoo Finance</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Why did Alphabet (GOOG, GOOGL) soar while Meta (META) plummeted in premarket, in the wake of respective earnings reports? In aviation, the divide between Boeing (BA) and Airbus (AIR.PA) deepens, with the American plane maker's stock sliding - while its European rival rallies. Chipotle (CMG) tanks nearly 19% in premarket, along with other restaurant chains (CAVA, WING, SHAK) also in the red. In semiconductors, Samsung (005930.KS) and Nvidia (NVDA) are trending. For more live coverage of markets watch the full episode of Market Sunrise and head to Yahoo Finance.",
